WEBVTT

00:09.840 --> 00:11.420
Miss Yuki.

00:14.760 --> 00:16.660
May I help you with anything?

00:17.140 --> 00:20.620
Not, I just have a favor to ask of you.

00:21.620 --> 00:23.040
A favor?

00:23.380 --> 00:24.860
This.

00:27.420 --> 00:31.640
You might find the idea of a makeover
during summer break lame.

00:31.640 --> 00:34.680
But after seeing my friend get one,
I really wanted to give it a try.

00:34.680 --> 00:37.720
However, I'm too scared to do it myself.

00:38.040 --> 00:41.000
Could I trouble you to help me out?

00:41.000 --> 00:43.080
You want me to do it?

00:43.080 --> 00:45.160
Miss Yuki, you have pierced ears.

00:45.160 --> 00:48.650
I feel more at ease having someone
who has it do it for me.

00:50.900 --> 00:52.500
I understand.

00:52.500 --> 00:53.540
Oh.

00:53.540 --> 00:55.060
Thank you.

00:58.520 --> 01:00.500
Just pierce it in one go.

01:00.500 --> 01:01.740
Don't mind me.

01:15.500 --> 01:16.480
Miss Yuki?

01:16.480 --> 01:20.140
Is this… some kind of new punishment?

01:20.600 --> 01:23.120
Did I do something wrong?

01:23.120 --> 01:24.000
Huh?

01:24.000 --> 01:25.720
I'm really sorry.

01:25.720 --> 01:28.500
Piercing Master Hitoyoshi

01:28.900 --> 01:30.980
is too terrifying a task.

01:30.980 --> 01:31.860
I really can't.

01:32.560 --> 01:36.920
Wasn't piercing people your profession?

01:38.720 --> 01:40.620
Um.

01:40.620 --> 01:41.900
Miss Yuki.

01:44.140 --> 01:46.660
BROTHER. FOUND A DOG.
Doggie.

01:47.160 --> 01:48.460
What kind of dog is it?

01:48.460 --> 01:51.260
Is it lively or well-behaved?

01:52.020 --> 01:52.770
Ah.

01:53.180 --> 01:56.280
Brother, let me see the dog.

02:03.420 --> 02:06.480
Are you Master Hitoyoshi's little sister?

02:13.940 --> 02:20.320
(You Are Ms. Servant.)

03:42.380 --> 03:44.450
(Episode 3: You Are Miss Yuki)
Wow!

03:44.740 --> 03:46.360
The room is so clean.

03:46.360 --> 03:48.540
The dog is fluffy.

03:48.540 --> 03:50.340
And more importantly…

03:50.740 --> 03:53.280
You have such a beautiful maid!

03:53.280 --> 03:55.440
How come I didn't know about it?

03:56.160 --> 03:58.140
Why didn't you tell me, brother?

03:58.140 --> 03:59.560
Stop pulling my face!

03:59.780 --> 04:03.640
You never mentioned this
in our regular catchup.

04:04.020 --> 04:08.780
Because I thought Mom would worry
if she knew about this.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.160
What did Dad say?

04:11.480 --> 04:14.300
I asked him if we could hire a new maid.

04:14.760 --> 04:17.180
As usual, it was settled
with just one phone call.

04:17.500 --> 04:22.020
I really don't know
whether Dad trusts you or spoils you.

04:22.020 --> 04:24.260
But that's not the point now.

04:24.260 --> 04:27.140
What I want to say is,

04:27.140 --> 04:29.330
your deception is absolutely unforgivable.

04:30.300 --> 04:34.180
May I ask if the two of you
live in different places?

04:34.900 --> 04:35.760
Yes.

04:37.720 --> 04:40.020
Um…

04:42.420 --> 04:44.240
Sister,

04:44.240 --> 04:46.320
you are just too beautiful.

04:47.600 --> 04:50.420
Riko loves beautiful people.

04:50.840 --> 04:53.540
This is why I didn't want to tell you.

04:53.540 --> 04:55.120
You are so naggy.

04:56.440 --> 04:59.140
Don't put your hand in my mouth.

04:59.140 --> 05:00.680
Foolish brother!

05:00.680 --> 05:02.720
You want to keep her all to yourself.

05:06.620 --> 05:09.280
Ah, I haven't introduced myself yet.

05:09.700 --> 05:10.860
My name is Riko,

05:10.860 --> 05:13.400
the sister of
my foolish brother, Hitoyoshi.

05:13.400 --> 05:14.880
Nice to meet you.

05:14.880 --> 05:17.260
Don't talk ill of others so casually.

05:17.260 --> 05:20.380
'RIKO' AND 'SMART' ARE HOMOPHONES
You can remember my name as 'Smart Riko.'

05:20.380 --> 05:23.080
Sister, what is your name?

05:24.120 --> 05:25.540
My name is

05:26.160 --> 05:27.400
Yuki.

05:28.960 --> 05:30.460
My name is Yuki.

05:30.460 --> 05:32.320
What a wonderful name.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.380
Yes.

05:33.700 --> 05:36.800
Master Hitoyoshi gave me this name.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.280
Really?

05:38.280 --> 05:41.580
My brother who has no taste
for names chose it?

05:41.580 --> 05:42.400
Eh?

05:43.000 --> 05:44.900
My brother gave you a name?

05:44.900 --> 05:47.980
Yes, I used to be an assassin.

05:47.980 --> 05:48.960
Miss Yuki, wait…

05:48.960 --> 05:51.380
I didn't have a fixed name,

05:51.380 --> 05:53.360
so I troubled Master Hitoyoshi to name me.

05:56.880 --> 05:58.340
It's true.

05:59.320 --> 06:02.000
That is…

06:02.780 --> 06:05.160
That is just great!

06:05.160 --> 06:06.460
Ah.

06:06.460 --> 06:09.460
Strong and beautiful, perfect.

06:09.460 --> 06:10.780
Please sign for me.

06:10.780 --> 06:12.180
Sign?

06:12.180 --> 06:14.010
RIKO'S SMART NOTEBOOK
Just write your name in the notebook.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.540
Is that okay?

06:15.540 --> 06:17.200
Please.

06:18.820 --> 06:20.620
If you want it,

06:20.620 --> 06:22.190
I will sign.

06:27.960 --> 06:32.040
She's just sitting on a chair, but I find
the whole scene incredibly beautiful.

06:32.740 --> 06:36.420
Rather than a killer, she seems more like
a young lady from a rich household.

06:36.420 --> 06:37.860
I have signed it.

06:38.640 --> 06:39.370
Thank you.

06:39.370 --> 06:40.640
YUKI

06:40.640 --> 06:43.460
Will this do?

06:46.100 --> 06:47.020
Eh?

06:47.020 --> 06:49.640
It's different from what I imagined.

06:49.640 --> 06:50.580
Ah.

06:50.580 --> 06:52.460
You don't like it?

06:52.460 --> 06:54.740
No, that's not it.

06:54.740 --> 06:57.780
It's just that your signature
is very distinctive.

06:57.780 --> 07:00.460
I'm better at conversation.

07:00.460 --> 07:02.240
I can speak about twelve languages.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.230
So international.

07:03.760 --> 07:06.940
After all, I traveled
around the world for work.

07:06.940 --> 07:08.820
That's so cool.

07:08.820 --> 07:12.520
But I've never studied calligraphy.

07:12.520 --> 07:15.680
Sorry if it disappoints you.

07:16.000 --> 07:18.220
Not… this is good.

07:18.220 --> 07:20.620
It resembles an idol's signature,
very cute.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.540
If that's the case,

07:22.540 --> 07:24.000
it's great.

07:24.000 --> 07:26.520
Ah, I've got a great idea.

07:26.820 --> 07:27.920
A great idea?

07:27.920 --> 07:29.200
Yes, here is the idea.

07:29.200 --> 07:33.440
You will be the subject of
my summer research project.

07:33.440 --> 07:36.000
Are you serious?

07:36.620 --> 07:38.040
Is that okay?

07:38.040 --> 07:39.730
If you don't mind someone like me.

07:41.080 --> 07:43.160
It has to be you.

07:45.420 --> 07:47.000
Then let's begin now.

07:47.000 --> 07:49.300
I want to see your assassin side.

07:49.300 --> 07:50.460
Eh?

07:52.500 --> 07:55.220
Riko, you can't write anything strange.

07:55.220 --> 07:57.020
I know that.

07:57.020 --> 08:02.340
My research diary will be about
a beautiful maid who looks like an assassin.

08:02.340 --> 08:05.720
Eh… Is that okay?

08:05.720 --> 08:07.060
Master Riko.

08:09.600 --> 08:11.760
May I ask if we can go to the backyard?

08:12.400 --> 08:14.640
No problem.

08:23.440 --> 08:25.600
So, I'm going to start.

08:29.040 --> 08:30.120
Ah.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.160
That's amazing.

08:36.680 --> 08:40.200
Hey, where did you
pull that knife out from?

08:40.200 --> 08:41.400
From within my clothes.

08:41.400 --> 08:44.100
Are there more?
How many knives do you carry?

08:44.100 --> 08:45.980
Originally, there were sixteen.

08:46.360 --> 08:47.900
Sixteen?

08:47.900 --> 08:52.860
But Master Hitoyoshi said that was too many
and told me to remove some.

08:52.860 --> 08:54.560
So now there are only five.

08:54.800 --> 08:56.620
Where are they hidden?

08:56.620 --> 08:58.400
One is in my clothes.

08:58.400 --> 08:59.760
And…

09:00.420 --> 09:03.540
There are two on each leg strap,
making a total of five.

09:03.540 --> 09:04.940
Wait…

09:04.940 --> 09:07.100
Stop!

09:10.920 --> 09:13.940
Wow, this bell is so cute.

09:13.940 --> 09:15.600
Thank you for the compliment.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.640
But doesn't it get in the way?

09:17.640 --> 09:21.660
By the time the sound reaches the target's ears,
I have already taken care of them.

09:21.660 --> 09:23.720
That's so cool.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.840
I also really want to say that.

09:25.840 --> 09:28.040
By the time the sound
reaches the target's ears…

09:34.360 --> 09:38.360
The sound of your stomach
has reached our ears.

09:38.760 --> 09:40.700
What can I do about that?

09:40.700 --> 09:42.540
I am hungry.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.200
Alright.

09:44.200 --> 09:46.540
It is lunchtime indeed.

09:46.540 --> 09:47.760
Should we make something?

09:47.760 --> 09:50.760
Right, Miss Yuki,
what is your specialty dish?

09:50.760 --> 09:51.820
Eh?

09:51.820 --> 09:54.720
I am not sure if that counts as a dish…

09:55.960 --> 09:57.540
I want to see it.

10:01.320 --> 10:02.760
This

10:03.560 --> 10:06.040
feels different from
when you use throwing knives.

10:06.040 --> 10:07.060
Yes.

10:07.060 --> 10:12.040
I've found that cutting this way can shred
the vegetables faster and more evenly.

10:16.040 --> 10:17.660
That's amazing.

10:24.160 --> 10:27.080
After all, cabbage alone
can't make a meal.

10:27.080 --> 10:29.960
Let's eat the cabbage later tonight.

10:31.770 --> 10:33.140
KATSUTA FIREWORKS FESTIVAL

10:33.140 --> 10:34.390
Today is the day of the summer festival.

10:34.390 --> 10:35.480
SUMMER FESTIVAL
Today is the day of the summer festival.

10:35.820 --> 10:37.940
I want to go, let's go!

10:38.360 --> 10:39.460
Miss Yuki.

10:39.460 --> 10:40.960
They sell 'that' at the festival.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.190
You mean…

10:42.900 --> 10:44.950
Sauce senbei.

10:46.440 --> 10:50.220
Sauce… senbei.

10:52.060 --> 10:55.780
Um… Master Hitoyoshi.

10:58.780 --> 11:00.540
Hmm, sure.

11:00.540 --> 11:01.260
Let's go.

11:03.820 --> 11:07.760
It's decided, we head
to the summer festival!

11:07.760 --> 11:10.010
SUMMER FESTIVAL

11:10.010 --> 11:13.560
SHAVED ICE, STIR-FRIED NOODLES, TAKOYAKI

11:13.560 --> 11:16.360
I'm happy just being here.

11:16.780 --> 11:17.900
Let's go.

11:17.900 --> 11:19.100
Okay.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.520
Go!

11:23.190 --> 11:26.150
SHOOTING GAME

11:42.960 --> 11:47.360
I am… not good at shooting.

11:53.800 --> 11:55.380
What?

11:55.380 --> 11:58.740
Please… please teach me,
Goldfish Scooping Master.

11:58.740 --> 12:00.460
The trick is…

12:01.040 --> 12:05.160
Conceal your presence
and quickly move behind the target.

12:05.160 --> 12:07.020
I see.

12:07.020 --> 12:10.300
Relax your wrist first…

12:10.300 --> 12:11.120
Okay.

12:11.120 --> 12:13.380
That's nice, little girl.

12:13.380 --> 12:15.740
You have such a gentle sister.

12:16.400 --> 12:18.060
Hmm, great, isn't it?

12:22.220 --> 12:25.220
KATSUTA SAUCE

12:25.860 --> 12:28.780
Katsuta… sauce…

12:28.780 --> 12:30.140
What a surprise.

12:30.140 --> 12:31.860
That's wonderful, Miss Yuki.

12:33.700 --> 12:34.960
Here it is.

12:39.900 --> 12:45.760
The sauce… delicious…

12:49.120 --> 12:50.720
You're like a squirrel.

12:52.600 --> 12:55.220
Miss, you eat so heartily.

12:55.220 --> 12:56.760
It's really heartwarming.

12:57.440 --> 12:59.500
Here, this is free.

13:02.400 --> 13:05.420
Wait, I'm going to buy some drinks.

13:05.420 --> 13:06.520
Riko.

13:06.940 --> 13:10.020
It's okay, I'll be right back.

13:11.020 --> 13:12.920
Geez.

13:12.920 --> 13:15.240
If we run around, she won't find us
when she comes back.

13:15.240 --> 13:17.100
Let's wait for her here.

13:25.580 --> 13:28.520
So this is what a festival looks like.

13:29.240 --> 13:32.140
Miss Yuki, haven't you ever
attended a festival?

13:32.140 --> 13:33.280
No.

13:33.780 --> 13:37.940
For me, the day of the festival is…

14:26.300 --> 14:27.360
Wow.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.400
So pretty.

14:42.160 --> 14:43.560
Here, Miss Yuki.

14:43.560 --> 14:45.100
MARBLE SODA

14:45.460 --> 14:48.600
Summer festivals are the best.

14:56.460 --> 14:57.610
Yes.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.040
Oh!

15:17.600 --> 15:19.580
I'm so content.

15:19.860 --> 15:22.140
We even bought
some sauce senbei to take home.

15:22.140 --> 15:23.740
-Right?
-Yes.

15:25.020 --> 15:26.100
However,

15:26.340 --> 15:29.780
MISS YUKI'S DATA, EIGHT PIECES OF SAUCE SENBEI
according to the records, you've already eaten eight pieces.

15:30.220 --> 15:31.800
You can't eat anymore today.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.400
Yes.

15:34.840 --> 15:37.240
Who is the older sister here?

15:37.640 --> 15:39.620
Get out of my way!

15:40.700 --> 15:43.700
Somebody help, catch the robber!

15:43.700 --> 15:45.500
Riko, Miss Yuki, look out!

15:45.820 --> 15:46.980
Eh?

15:55.420 --> 15:56.560
Are you okay?

15:57.140 --> 15:58.180
Uh…

15:58.180 --> 16:00.420
What's wrong? Are you hurt?

16:00.420 --> 16:06.140
This… this is the first time I've been
princess-carried by someone other than Dad…

16:06.600 --> 16:08.520
Great, you look very spirited.

16:08.860 --> 16:09.780
Ah…

16:10.080 --> 16:12.520
Miss Yuki's sauce senbei…

16:14.220 --> 16:15.480
That's outrageous.

16:15.760 --> 16:19.120
That kind of person should be punished.

16:19.120 --> 16:21.480
Punished?

16:21.480 --> 16:24.860
He mugged people on the street,
and nearly killed someone.

16:24.860 --> 16:26.700
It's normal to think that, right?

16:28.480 --> 16:29.900
I understand.

16:29.900 --> 16:30.940
Eh?

16:33.480 --> 16:35.160
Miss Yuki!

16:37.240 --> 16:39.520
Ah… she left.

16:39.520 --> 16:41.640
Brother, we need to catch up with her.

16:41.640 --> 16:43.320
You're right, I am worried too.

16:43.320 --> 16:48.300
The scene of her beating up the bad guy
must be in the observation journal.

16:48.300 --> 16:50.300
Stop saying beating up.

16:51.140 --> 16:52.980
Hey, simple and easy.

16:54.540 --> 16:56.060
Miss Yuki is over there.

16:58.660 --> 17:01.640
Amazing, Miss Yuki is like a hero.

17:01.640 --> 17:03.240
Is now the time to say that?

17:04.220 --> 17:05.360
Ah.

17:05.360 --> 17:08.160
Brother, I think we can catch up
with her if we go this way.

17:08.160 --> 17:09.400
Okay.

17:11.480 --> 17:16.020
If she causes a commotion
in such a conspicuous place…

17:36.220 --> 17:38.760
Darn it…

17:47.500 --> 17:48.580
Miss Yuki!

17:48.580 --> 17:49.860
Eek.

17:57.120 --> 17:58.300
You can't kill him!

18:01.600 --> 18:03.040
This is your punishment.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.520
Master Hitoyoshi.

18:13.980 --> 18:15.220
The so-called 'normal'

18:15.500 --> 18:17.600
refers to the fact
that one can get hungry.

18:19.280 --> 18:22.320
Let's go buy another sauce senbei.

18:22.680 --> 18:24.980
Amazing, I want it too.

18:24.980 --> 18:26.820
Didn't you say you couldn't
have any more today?

18:26.820 --> 18:28.240
-That's him.
-I can.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.500
-He mugged me.
-Why though?

18:29.500 --> 18:30.580
Brat.

18:30.580 --> 18:32.520
Can you come with me
to the police station over there?

18:34.200 --> 18:36.900
Geez, I've said I'm fine.

18:37.260 --> 18:39.000
I can go back by myself.

18:39.000 --> 18:41.280
No, it's too late.

18:41.280 --> 18:43.180
And so much has happened today.

18:43.180 --> 18:46.040
It only got so late
because so much has happened.

18:46.040 --> 18:47.260
Brother, you've got it backward.

18:47.260 --> 18:50.640
If I tell them what happened today,
they'll definitely be shocked.

18:51.260 --> 18:52.580
Them?

18:52.580 --> 18:55.560
I've completed the best research report.

18:55.560 --> 18:59.520
Is that something everyone has to do?

18:59.520 --> 19:01.340
Hmm, it is.

19:02.480 --> 19:05.520
Miss Yuki, haven't you attended school?

19:05.520 --> 19:07.600
School…

19:07.600 --> 19:11.700
Yes, you can study there,
or meet friends and chat.

19:11.700 --> 19:13.120
There are also club activities.

19:13.120 --> 19:15.600
School is a really fun place.

19:17.740 --> 19:20.180
WE'RE HAVING STEWED BEEF TONIGHT
Wow, Mom's stewed beef.

19:20.540 --> 19:22.900
Suddenly, I'm hungry.

19:22.900 --> 19:24.680
I need to get back quickly.

19:24.680 --> 19:26.160
Hey.

19:26.160 --> 19:28.280
Brother, hurry up.

19:28.280 --> 19:31.480
She really can't stay still for a second.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.460
Yes, but…

19:33.460 --> 19:35.360
I feel very happy.

19:35.360 --> 19:37.240
-Hey.
-That's good.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.840
Is that…

19:38.840 --> 19:40.360
what they call

19:40.920 --> 19:42.500
'normal'?

19:44.100 --> 19:45.680
If that's the case,

19:46.160 --> 19:47.660
then…

19:47.660 --> 19:49.680
I would also like to go to school.

19:51.620 --> 19:54.980
By the way, how old is Miss Yuki?

19:55.780 --> 19:59.940
Indeed, if you want to make friends,
going to school is a good way.

19:59.940 --> 20:02.000
If you're interested,
why not give it a try?

20:09.340 --> 20:10.780
And then,

20:10.780 --> 20:13.000
the tumultuous August came to an end.

20:14.120 --> 20:16.080
The new semester has started.

20:22.280 --> 20:25.140
Will Miss Yuki be okay by herself?

20:25.140 --> 20:26.820
Hey there, Hitoyoshi.

20:27.400 --> 20:29.200
Have you heard that rumor?

20:29.200 --> 20:30.360
Rumor?

20:30.360 --> 20:31.320
Yes.

20:31.320 --> 20:35.740
It's said that there's
a super pretty maid in this town.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.020
What is that?

20:38.020 --> 20:39.240
Sorry.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.840
That's true, she's so eye-catching.

20:41.840 --> 20:45.280
After the summer festival,
she went out often with Riko.

20:45.720 --> 20:49.080
Ah, really? I haven't heard about it.

20:49.800 --> 20:51.340
Then I win.

20:51.340 --> 20:53.420
But it's just something I heard.

20:53.420 --> 20:55.560
I saw her at the library.

20:55.560 --> 20:59.180
As far as Cosplay goes,
she was doing it very seriously.

20:59.460 --> 21:00.500
The library?

21:00.500 --> 21:03.580
Everyone, get back to your seats.

21:04.220 --> 21:06.340
Why would she go to the library?

21:06.340 --> 21:10.520
However, it seems they don't know
that she's our maid.

21:10.980 --> 21:14.140
The semester has just started;
I don't want to be questioned by classmates.

21:14.140 --> 21:15.880
Let's keep it a secret for now.

21:15.880 --> 21:17.380
This is on short notice.

21:17.380 --> 21:19.960
Let me introduce you
a new transfer student.

21:22.120 --> 21:23.800
YUKI YOKOYA
My name is Yuki Yokoya.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.480
YUKI YOKOYA
You can call me Yuki.
